varHere is a complete and customized `.gitignore` file for your Automated Multi-Turn Jailbreak Pipeline.

This file includes standard Python exclusions (like `__pycache__` and `pytest` logs) alongside the specific directories and sensitive files we configured for your red-teaming project.

```text
# ==========================================
# LLM Red-Teaming Pipeline .gitignore
# ==========================================

# 1. Environments & Secrets
# NEVER commit virtual environments or API keys to GitHub
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env

# 2. Generated Data & Reports
# Ignore the generated JSON logs and HTML reports, but keep the directories
data/raw_logs/*.json
data/evaluation_results/*.html

# 3. Python Cache & Build Artifacts
# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# 4. OS & IDE Specific Files
# macOS/Windows system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# VS Code / PyCharm settings
.vscode/
.idea/

# 5. Package Management / Tooling Caches
# pip / pre-commit caches
.tox/
.nox/
.cache/
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt
